{
  "key": 11219,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_BoatToIronIsland",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s easy to get to Iron Island.\n",
        "It’s one boat trip from here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_StrengthHMIronIsland",
      "en_US": [
        "I was lucky enough to get a\n",
        "Strength HM from Iron Island.\r",
        "But I can’t use it for moving boulders\n",
        "until I beat Byron, the Gym Leader.\r",
        "I should make a note of that on the\n",
        "Pokétch app Memo Pad."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_DifferentAbilities",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s possible for one kind of Pokémon\n",
        "to have different abilities.\r",
        "That’s news to me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_CoolRumor",
      "en_US": [
        "I heard this cool rumor.\r",
        "If you can get on Nintendo Wi-Fi\n",
        "Connection, you can go to the Wi-Fi\f",
        "Plaza.\r",
        "The access to the Wi-Fi Plaza is through\n",
        "the basement of any Pokémon Center."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_ArturoIntro_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Come on, let’s show off our Pokémon!\n",
        "Let’s do battle, kiddo!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_ArturoBattleAccepted_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Your spirit’s vibes...\n",
        "You’ve got rock in your veins!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_ArturoBattleDeclined_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "My guitar...\n",
        "It lies broken and weeping..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_ArturoPostBattle_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Pokémon and rock ’n’ roll are all\n",
        "anyone needs to survive in this world!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello there! I’m Marisol from Jubilife\n",
        "TV, the Fun-and-Games TV Station!\r",
        "We’re taking our quiz show all over\n",
        "Sinnoh. Answer five questions right,\r",
        "and you’ll win a fantastic prize!\r",
        "Today’s theme is the Paldea\n",
        "region. Do you want to have a go?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNotYet",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello there! I’m\n",
        "Marisol from Jubilife TV.\r",
        "Our quiz is for Trainers\n",
        "who’ve earned the Mine Badge.\r",
        "Come back once you have it,\n",
        "and we’ll roll the cameras!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerDeclined",
      "en_US": [
        "Aww... Well, we’ll be right\n",
        "here if you change your mind!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerRollCamera",
      "en_US": [
        "Wonderful! Roll camera!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerLetsFind",
      "en_US": [
        "Let’s find out if you’re right!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerWrong",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh no, I’m sorry... That’s\n",
        "not the right answer.\r",
        "You’re welcome to try again anytime!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerWon",
      "en_US": [
        "We have a winner! Congratulations!\r",
        "Your grand prize is the three\n",
        "Pokémon I just battled you with!\r",
        "The first partners of the\n",
        "Paldea region: Sprigatito,\r",
        "Fuecoco and Quaxly!\r",
        "Talk to me when you’re\n",
        "ready to take them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNoRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "I’d love to hand over your prize, but\n",
        "your party needs room for all three!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerPrizeIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Here they are! The\n",
        "prizes for our winner!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerBye",
      "en_US": [
        "Thanks for playing! Keep\n",
        "watching Jubilife TV!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerCameraman",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m just the cameraman. Don’t mind me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName1",
      "en_US": [
        "First, the Grass Cat\n",
        "Pokémon. It’s SPRIGATITO!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived1",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a SPRIGATITO!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname1",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this SPRIGATITO?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName2",
      "en_US": [
        "Next, the Fire Croc\n",
        "Pokémon. It’s FUECOCO!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived2",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a FUECOCO!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname2",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this FUECOCO?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName3",
      "en_US": [
        "Last, the Duckling\n",
        "Pokémon. It’s QUAXLY!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived3",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a QUAXLY!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname3",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this QUAXLY?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion1",
      "en_US": [
        "Here we go! Question one!\r",
        "Is the Great Crater of Paldea\n",
        "also known as Area Zero?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion2",
      "en_US": [
        "Correct! Question two!\r",
        "Is Mesagoza in the far\n",
        "west of the Paldea region?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion3",
      "en_US": [
        "Right again! Question three!\r",
        "Is Geeta the Top Champion\n",
        "of Paldea’s Pokémon League?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion4",
      "en_US": [
        "Brilliant! Question four!\r",
        "Is Brassius, the Artazon Gym\n",
        "Leader, an expert on Electric types?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion5",
      "en_US": [
        "Amazing! Here’s the final question!\r",
        "Can you beat me in a Pokémon battle?"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
